The kawa jars in this directory include modifications for App Inventor.

The changes are in the file
kawa-1.11-changes.diff

Both jars are built from https://github.com/mit-cml/ai2-kawa with "ant appinventor"
(see that repository's README for the JDK to use):

  kawa-1.11-compiler.jar  The full jar. The buildserver compiles YAIL with it.
  kawa-1.11-runtime.jar   The classes an app can load on the device. The buildserver
                          dexes it into every app.
